<title>USA: Baltimore Gas files for $200 mln of notes.</title>
<headline>Baltimore Gas files for $200 mln of notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baltimore Gas and Electric Co filed a shelf registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission on Friday for up to $200 million in medium-term notes.</p>
<p>The company said net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, including repayment of commerical paper borrowings used to finance construction, other capital expenditures and operations.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through agents Lehman Brothers and Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
</text>
